each role ensures that compliance remains part of daily business, not just annual audit event.


in short, for Ro's Shoe Food, establishing a compliance program means more than checking boxes, its about building structured, traceable processes that prove accountability. compliance protects Ro from legal, financial, and reputational harm, while integrated risk management ensures the business remains adaptable. by linking every requirement to a control and maintaining alignment with enterprise goals, Ro's Shoe Food strengthens both its trustworthiness and its ability to grow safely.





