⦁	assessments: some companies may self-assess, while others must undergo third party audits depending on the require level
⦁	alignment: built around NIST SP 800-171 and NIST SP 800-172, making compliance more streamlined for organization already using NIST controls


for Ro's Shoe Food, this means that if he wants to contract with government agencies, his IT systems must meet strict cybersecurity standards. achieving CMMC certification demonstrated that his business can be trusted to protect sensitive government data.


