How the Four Components Work Together


*these four components (Frame, Assess, Respond, Monitor) are not isolated. they feed into each other through constant communication and feedback loops, creating an evolving, organization wide view of risk



for Ro's Shoe Food:

⦁	risk framing defines what matters
⦁	risk assessment measures the threat
⦁	risk response puts controls in motion
⦁	risk monitoring ensures those controls continue to work


*together, they create a living system of governance that adapts as the business evolves, keeping Ro's operations compliant, secure, and sustainable





in short, Ro's Shoe Food manages risk through four interconnected components:

⦁	frame: define what risk means and where to draw the line
⦁	assess: identify and measure what could go wrong
