Why HIPAA and FISMA Matter to Ro's Shoe Food


*both laws illustrate how compliance obligations depend on who you serve and what type of data you handle. even though Ro sells "shoe food", the moment his operations touch government systems or medical data, he's bound by strict federal laws governing cybersecurity and privacy.


